{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "d6c69225d010deeb7804ad25b3c3f808f51379ea3252e7c5242297eaa4734954", "ja": "特撮ヒーロー映画のお仕事", "zh": "特摄英雄电影工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3001_013hib", "source_sha256": "62d8c1906b9e4aa99d54eef98133af6505ce3b9460d7541b8be9716acd3d4dd4", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}。\n今回の自分の役って、すっごく悪いヤツなんだよね？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n本人这次的角色，是个超级大坏蛋吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3002_p", "source_sha256": "de1f292bba5237eae7e07d8784823c4612d83de50898f3f8336539a493ce29b8", "ja": "ああ。なんといっても、悪の組織の親玉だからな。\nそれがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯，毕竟是邪恶组织的头目啊。\n那怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3003_013hib", "source_sha256": "7f917c1f009945ca7c937dd61941bb10601fc528211924ca42c76e40b8d0c4a7", "ja": "つまり、自分の演技がカンペキ過ぎるほど、子どもを\n怖がらせるってことだよね。なんか、可哀想だぞ～。", "zh": "也就是说，本人的演技越是完美，就越会让\n小孩子害怕吧。总觉得这样好可怜喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3004_013hib", "source_sha256": "2723a710cfa27b468fc33247698a670d941126fe450bba5b02238663ee4ee994", "ja": "正義のヒーロー役だったら、遠慮しないで\n思いっきりカンペキにできたのに。残念さ～。", "zh": "如果是正义英雄的角色，本人就不需要客气，\n可以尽情完美演出了说，太可惜啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3005_p", "source_sha256": "fa38f794940707cf24676ac5c4f5bbf01406da877824474d1b68010dff12775a", "ja": "つまり、ヒーロー役が良かったってことか。\n響の気持ちはわかるが……。", "zh": "也就是说，你觉得英雄角色比较好的意思吗？\n我明白响的心情，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3006", "source_sha256": "ba0b21825ff0c0244cad0e99caf3e42b8f1ca9885972a517a8528c9757c4400d", "ja": "怖がらせてOK！", "zh": "让小孩子害怕也OK！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3007", "source_sha256": "b6a93161990cf3c286bcbb34814665272e51918ae62f2a64dc7e0788697f5401", "ja": "今はガマン！", "zh": "现在先忍耐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3200_p", "source_sha256": "6f3c80c0f86e2ee3926f79b315e369c1a3a96200941c7e261e5bb2f716a040f3", "ja": "むしろ、思いきり怖がらせよう。\n怖い悪役を倒すから、ヒーローは魅力的に見えるんだ。", "zh": "我倒觉得，就尽情让小孩子害怕吧。\n英雄就是要打倒可怕的坏人，才能展现魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3201_013hib", "source_sha256": "f90231c87feb757de45161e00b548a8b5a9300c4c6704b3c11c7e81ef64a6a21", "ja": "あ、それもそうだね。怖くない悪役を倒したら、\nヒーローが悪く見えそうだし。", "zh": "啊，这么说也对。如果打倒不可怕的坏人，\n那英雄看起来就会像坏人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3202_013hib", "source_sha256": "be9a22e7e98994ec86f02657589084c2cc39e191bd9327ce9203fb0122a61856", "ja": "わかったぞ、{$P$}！\n自分はカンペキな悪役として、全力で暴れてくるねっ！", "zh": "本人知道了喔，{$P$}！\n本人会当个完美的坏人，尽全力做坏事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3300_p", "source_sha256": "6f3c80c0f86e2ee3926f79b315e369c1a3a96200941c7e261e5bb2f716a040f3", "ja": "むしろ、思いきり怖がらせよう。\n怖い悪役を倒すから、ヒーローは魅力的に見えるんだ。", "zh": "我倒觉得，就尽情让小孩子害怕吧。\n英雄就是要打倒可怕的坏人，才能展现魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3301_013hib", "source_sha256": "e45e9312d348d0f670b38bb2cad6c8d582021cee3e17df74f3fd390c1eba3504", "ja": "で、でも、怖すぎて途中で泣いちゃった子は、\n最後まで見れないかもしれないでしょ？", "zh": "可、可是，演得太可怕的话，被吓哭的小孩子\n说不定就不敢看下去了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3302_013hib", "source_sha256": "d1e34b51cfb2b0b7889e1b1a5c268f325141b4042043f018eee3773aaa63baca", "ja": "それに自分、ちっちゃい子達に嫌われたくないし……。\nカンタンに言わないでほしいぞっ！", "zh": "而且本人，不想被小朋友们讨厌啊……\n希望你别说得这么简单喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3500_p", "source_sha256": "579acb2b1e1ea5f36e5231d425e15d582c7aa38dcfdeb757ef308c1403d6eddf", "ja": "この役を次に繋げよう。ここでいい演技をすれば、\nいつかヒーロー役がもらえるはずだ。", "zh": "把这角色当作是争取下次的机会吧，这里只要能演得好，\n应该总有一天可以演出英雄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3501_013hib", "source_sha256": "f3e852247d82e57066b85cfec9cfacb3f49f6c347e5c4e29b5ea242dbe431d87", "ja": "べ、別に、自分はヒーロー役が欲しいわけじゃないぞ？\nただ、自分にはその方が合ってる気がしただけで……。", "zh": "本、本人并不是想演英雄喔。\n只是觉得本人比较适合那种角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3502_013hib", "source_sha256": "61ef9f488dffdff58819aad3a96d66d65f2dee49d94aa30568a16542afb1338b", "ja": "で、でも、そんなに言うなら仕方ないっ。\n自分、ヒーロー並みにカッコイイ悪役として頑張るね！", "zh": "不、不过，既然你都这么说，那就没办法了。\n本人会努力演出和英雄一样帅气的坏人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3600_p", "source_sha256": "579acb2b1e1ea5f36e5231d425e15d582c7aa38dcfdeb757ef308c1403d6eddf", "ja": "この役を次に繋げよう。ここでいい演技をすれば、\nいつかヒーロー役がもらえるはずだ。", "zh": "把这角色当作是争取下次的机会吧，这里只要能演得好，\n应该总有一天可以演出英雄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3601_013hib", "source_sha256": "1ffd117fcf3475c877e4570598f0f5856fb0c364b2ca0746b7c4163132e4bcdb", "ja": "でも、自分のことだから、悪役がカンペキすぎて、\n悪役の仕事ばっかりくる気がするぞ……？", "zh": "不过，以本人的能力，要是坏人演得太完美，\n感觉以后上门的工作都会是反派角色喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_013hib_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_013hib_3602_013hib", "source_sha256": "0b67eacefed948151dfae958020356fa6516f92d1b5fbfa2a647e398c551e23a", "ja": "よし、決めた！　自分、そこそこ怖い悪役を目指すね！\nはっはっはー！　世界はわりと自分のモノさー！", "zh": "好，决定了！本人要以普通恐怖的坏人为目标！\n哈哈哈──！世界还算是在本人的掌控之中啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
